% Reuters-21578 text categorization collection, "Apte" (ModApte) split,
% converted to sparse ARFF: 8941 documents, 10105 numeric term-frequency
% features, 33 categories. Attribute names (a1..a10105) and class names
% (cls0..cls32) are anonymized -- the vocabulary and the category labels are
% not part of this file, so no article text is recoverable from it.
%
% The copyright for the text of the newswire articles and Reuters annotations
% resides with Reuters Ltd. Reuters Ltd. and Carnegie Group, Inc. have agreed
% to allow the free distribution of this data for research purposes only.
% Please refer to the source collection as "Reuters-21578, Distribution 1.0";
% see http://www.daviddlewis.com/resources/testcollections/reuters21578/

% Note: this sparse ARFF data file is correct according to ARFF specification.
% Due to a bug in FST ARFF filter it will not be read correctly in FST up to 
% version 3.1.0.b. It will be read correctly in FST 3.1.1.b where the bug is fixed.

